ent-RustedThruster = rusted propulsor de shuttle
    .desc = An unrepairable thruster, broken down from wear and tear. Only útil para scrapping.
ent-ShuttleGunAK570 = AK570 90mm Artillery cañón
    .desc = A rapid-fire 90mm artillery cañón optimized for overwhelming volume of fire. Higher caliber than the Dravon with more explosivo force per shell, though its shorter barrel means slightly less range. cargador-fed, 20-round capacity.
ent-ShuttleGunApollo = Apollo Heavy Laser cañón
    .desc = A precision ship-to-ship plasma cañón. Fires focused plasma bolts that deal concentrated heat damage with a small detonation radius — ideal for disabling enemy systems without collateral devastation. Sustained fire possible while power cells remain. [Hardpoint Class]
ent-ShuttleGunAutocannon = L85 20mm autocannon
    .desc = A luz 20mm ballistic autocannon for anti-personnel suppression. Fires fully automatic while the trigger is held. Rounds are too small to damage walls or structures — effective against infantry and unarmored targets only. [luz Class]
ent-ShuttleGunBase = cañón de shuttle
ent-ShuttleGunCharon = M321-CHARYBDIS 'Thanatos' 280mm Railgun
    .desc = A single-shot electromagnetic railgun of unparalleled destructive capability. Accelerates a 280mm slug to devastating velocities. The estándar kinetic slug punches through layered armour and structure with minimal blast — a surgical penetrator. Load a subnuclear slug instead to trade penetration for a ship-annihilating nuclear detonation. Requires manual loading of each round. Named for the devouring whirlpool of legend.
ent-ShuttleGunCyerxa120mm = CYERXA Dual 120mm Cannons
    .desc = A powerful dual 120mm cañón system diseñado para pesado shuttle combat. Fires devastating blast grenades with extreme destructive power. Each activation fires both barrels in rapid succession.
ent-ShuttleGunDravon = Dravon 75mm Artillery cañón
    .desc = A full-automatic 75mm artillery cañón diseñado para sustained suppression fire. Despite its smaller caliber compared to the AK570, its longer barrel and higher muzzle velocity give it greater effective range. cargador-fed, 15-round capacity.
ent-ShuttleGunDuster = EXP-2100g "Duster"
    .desc = A powerful stationary granada lanzador. A cartucho is required for use.
ent-ShuttleGunDynamre = AMX-9 DYNAMRE Dual Turbolaser
    .desc = A twin-barreled plasma cañón built for violent area destruction. Each trigger pull launches two massive plasma blobs simultaneously — each detonating in a catastrophic explosion that obliterates armour, crew, and structure alike. Significantly heavier than the Apollo and requires an Omega-capacity power cage. [Capital Class]
ent-ShuttleGunFriendship = EXP-320g "Friendship"
    .desc = A small stationary granada lanzador that holds 2 grenades.
ent-ShuttleGunKinetic = PTK-800 "Matter Dematerializer"
    .desc = Salvage stationary mining torreta. Gradually accumulates charges on its own, extremely effective for asteroid excavation.
ent-ShuttleGunKineticOld = exomorphic dematerializer
    .desc = An antiguo ship arma de fuego, utilizing biomechanical systems to store and release energy. While unique in its design, it has been rendered obsolete due to its inferior charging and firing speed compared to mechanical constructions.
ent-ShuttleGunLeviathan = Leviathan 240mm Siege cañón
    .desc = The largest area-of-effect artillery piece cleared for shuttle deployment. This monstrous 240mm siege cañón fires a single manually-loaded HE shell that detonates in a catastrophic blast radius, obliterating everything within its kill zone. It does not discriminate between armour, crew, and structure. Extremely difficult to anchor. Each shot requires physically inserting a 240mm shell into the open breech. The Leviathan does not forgive mistakes.
ent-ShuttleGunPerforator = LSE-1200c "Perforator"
    .desc = avanzado stationary laser unit. Annihilates electronics and is extremely peligroso to health! Uses the power cage to fire.
ent-ShuttleGunPirateCannon = pirate ship cañón
    .desc = ¡Bum!
ent-ShuttleGunScylla = Scylla Laser Railgun
    .desc = An experimental capital-class energy railgun. Charges enormous amounts of ship power into a single concentrated laser bolt that travels at extreme velocity, burning through armour and detonating in an intense focused blast on impact. The energy draw is so severe it lata destabilise under-powered ships. Draws directly from the ship's APC grid. [Capital Class]
ent-ShuttleGunSvalinnMachineGun = ametralladora Svalinn LSE-400c
    .desc = Unidad láser estacionaria básica. Eficaz contra objetivos vivos.
ent-ShuttleGunTarnyx = SSG-TARNYX EMP granada cañón
    .desc = A pesado-duty electromagnetic granada lobber. Fires EMP grenades in a wide arc, diseñado para saturate an area with electromagnetic pulses and disable enemy ship systems. Holds 4 rounds. Does not cause structural damage.
ent-ShuttleGunVanyk = Vanyk-MK2 Multi-Rocket System
    .desc = A 60mm single-shot rocket lanzador system. Each pull of the trigger launches one rocket. Accurate and reliable, well suited for precision strikes against individual targets. Uses cargador-fed 30-round capacity.
